@startuml
title UC2 - View Review Comments
skinparam style strictuml

actor Developer

boundary "Review Comments Page" as ReviewUI
control "Review Controller" as ReviewCtrl
entity "PullRequest" as PullRequest
entity "ReviewComment" as ReviewComment
entity "Issue" as Issue

Developer -> ReviewUI : openPullRequestPage(pullRequestID)
ReviewUI -> ReviewCtrl : fetchComments(pullRequestID)
ReviewCtrl -> PullRequest : getPullRequest(pullRequestID)
ReviewCtrl -> ReviewComment : getReviewComments(pullRequestID)
ReviewCtrl -> Issue : getIssues(pullRequestID)
ReviewCtrl -> ReviewUI : returnComments(comments[])
ReviewUI -> Developer : displayCommentsWithContext(comments[])
Developer -> ReviewUI : applyFilter(filterCriteria)
ReviewUI -> ReviewCtrl : filterComments(filterCriteria)
ReviewCtrl -> ReviewComment : getFilteredComments(filterCriteria)
ReviewCtrl -> ReviewUI : returnFilteredComments(comments[])
ReviewUI -> Developer : displayFilteredComments(comments[])
Developer -> ReviewUI : markAsViewed(commentID)
ReviewUI -> ReviewCtrl : updateCommentStatus(commentID)
ReviewCtrl -> ReviewComment : markViewed(commentID)

@enduml
